25:T522,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which terminal do international flights use at Jeddah Airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"International flights arrive at Terminal 1, with immigration on Level 0 and baggage claim in Halls A–D depending on your flight. Domestic flights use the North Terminal."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I find my driver at Jeddah Airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your pre-booked Taxi Saudi Arabia driver waits in the arrivals Meet Zone holding a name sign. You can also message the driver directly via the WhatsApp link in your booking confirmation SMS."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Jeddah Airport from Makkah and Madinah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Makkah is about 80 km (roughly a 1-hour drive) and Madinah about 420 km (roughly 4–5 hours) from JED. A pre-booked private transfer is the most direct option with luggage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I pre-book a taxi or take one at the airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pre-booking is recommended — it gives you a clear price confirmed on WhatsApp, a driver waiting on arrival, and avoids airport queues and surge pricing, especially after a long international flight."}}]}1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Jeddah Airport Arrivals — Full Walk-Through\",\"description\":\"Terminal layout, immigration queues, baggage claim zones, VIP arrival halls, and how to find your Taxi Saudi Arabia driver.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/guides/jeddah-airport-guide\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/guides/jeddah-airport-guide\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Taxi Saudi